        "TileImage": "$($repository 633398ac-c4b4-4441-852d-ae6460172025).Image",
        "Description": "You know that prick Agent Green? We had a convo the other day because he&apos;s running around on his roof every evening without thinking of any risks. His main argument was, that the only sniper rifle available is inside the building, so no worries there.\rAnyway, he&apos;s getting on my nerves for way too long now.  I filled the sniper rifle with Paintbal bullets. Just get the rifle and mark his head. Make sure not to harm anyone else than Agent Green.",
